      "text": "No.55/4/CF-66\nGOVERNMENT OF INDIA\nCABINET SECRETARIAT\n(Department of Cabinet Affairs)\nNew Delhi, the 31st January 1966.\n---\nThe undersigned is directed to state that the\ndesignation of Shri A.M. Thomas, Minister of State in the\nMinistry of Defence will be as Minister of Defence Production\nin the Ministry of Defence:"
